{"id":"03ca577eb4c1b05e","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md","title":"Weak Derivative","display":"df-weak-derivative — Weak Derivative","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-weak-derivative","aliases":["58-df-weak-derivative","Weak Derivative"],"display":"df-weak-derivative — Weak Derivative","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-bochner-integral.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-test-function.md]]","[[58-df-locally-integrable-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-weak-derivative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-weak-derivative</span><span>Weak Derivative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weak-derivative — Weak Derivative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e0348ed2298c600\" href=\"?note=9e0348ed2298c600\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-bochner-integral.md\">../batch05/58-df-bochner-integral.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"458fd0dccec3665f\" href=\"?note=458fd0dccec3665f\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-test-function.md\">../batch06/58-df-test-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83e0b1063552231c\" href=\"?note=83e0b1063552231c\" title=\"58-df-locally-integrable-data.md\">58-df-locally-integrable-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in L^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\">\\(u,v\\in L^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)\\subseteq V\">\\(C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)\\subseteq V\\)</span> (test-function space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"458fd0dccec3665f\" href=\"?note=458fd0dccec3665f\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-test-function.md\">../batch06/58-df-test-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\mu_\\Omega\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\mu_\\Omega\\in V\\)</span> are the Borel sigma algebra and restricted Lebesgue measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R},+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R},|\\cdot|\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R},+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R},|\\cdot|\\in V\\)</span> are the standard measurable and Banach-space data on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\">\\(\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\\)</span> (signed scalar integral predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9e0348ed2298c600\" href=\"?note=9e0348ed2298c600\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-bochner-integral.md\">../batch05/58-df-bochner-integral.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (weak-derivative predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)\">\\(L^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83e0b1063552231c\" href=\"?note=83e0b1063552231c\" title=\"./58-df-locally-integrable-data.md\">58-df-locally-integrable-data.md</a> 的实值代表函数集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\mu_\\Omega=\\lambda_\\Omega\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\mu_\\Omega=\\lambda_\\Omega\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\)</span> 采用该依赖中的唯一欧氏 Borel 数据。不是任意选取一个测度空间。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^\\alpha\\phi\">\\(D^\\alpha\\phi\\)</span> 表示唯一满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(g,\\phi,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{MultiDerivative}_S(g,\\phi,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\\)</span> 的实函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto v(x)\\phi(x)\">\\(x\\mapsto v(x)\\phi(x)\\)</span> 等均为定义域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 的函数图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\alpha|=\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\">\\(|\\alpha|=\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^0=\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\mathbb R^0=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\varnothing\">\\(\\alpha=\\varnothing\\)</span>；零阶弱导数在该离散零维载体上由 Assertion 的第二支给出，不调用仅在正维定义的测试函数空间。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\Bigl[n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\n\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\n\\land u,v\\in L^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\phi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)\\;\\exists I_v,I_u\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(I_v,x\\mapsto v(x)\\phi(x),\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\mu_\\Omega,\n\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R},|\\cdot|)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land\n\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(I_u,x\\mapsto u(x)D^\\alpha\\phi(x),\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\mu_\\Omega,\n\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R},|\\cdot|)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land I_v=(-1)^{|\\alpha|}I_u\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\lor\\Bigl[n=0\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^0\\land\\alpha=\\varnothing\\land u,v\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\land u=v\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\Bigl[n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\n\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\n\\land u,v\\in L^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\phi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)\\;\\exists I_v,I_u\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(I_v,x\\mapsto v(x)\\phi(x),\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\mu_\\Omega,\n\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R},|\\cdot|)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land\n\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(I_u,x\\mapsto u(x)D^\\alpha\\phi(x),\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\mu_\\Omega,\n\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R},|\\cdot|)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land I_v=(-1)^{|\\alpha|}I_u\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\lor\\Bigl[n=0\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^0\\land\\alpha=\\varnothing\\land u,v\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\land u=v\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>正维分支以实测试函数的积分恒等式定义弱导数；零维分支为零阶恒等关系。</li>\n<li>局部可积性本身不蕴含全局 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,1}(\\Omega)\">\\(W^{k,1}(\\Omega)\\)</span> 归属；全局 Sobolev 条件使用对应文件中的各阶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span> 条件。</li>\n<li>所有测度、测试空间及导数取值已在 Hypothesis 与依赖的 Assertion 中指定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Evans, Partial Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Adams and Fournier, Sobolev Spaces</li>\n<li>Ziemer, Weakly Differentiable Functions</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-bochner-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"9e0348ed2298c600","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-bochner-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-test-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"458fd0dccec3665f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-test-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-locally-integrable-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"83e0b1063552231c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-locally-integrable-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-test-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"458fd0dccec3665f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C_c^\\infty(\\Omega)\\subseteq V$ (test-function space, see [[../batch06/58-df-test-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-bochner-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"9e0348ed2298c600","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S\\subseteq V^{11}$ (signed scalar integral predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-bochner-integral.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-locally-integrable-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"83e0b1063552231c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerp